          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Return & Exchange Eligibility",
            "text": "<p>To be eligible for a return or exchange, the product must generally:</p><ul><li>Be unused and unworn.<br/></li><li>Be unwashed and unaltered.<br/></li><li>Be in its original condition.<br/></li><li>Have the original tags and packaging intact.<br/></li><li>Be accompanied by the order details or proof of purchase.<br/></li></ul><p>Products that have been worn, washed, altered, damaged, or used may not be eligible for return or exchange, except where required by applicable law.</p>"
