          "settings": {
            "title": "Refunds",
            "text": "<p>If a refund is approved, it will generally be processed through the original payment method where possible.</p><p>The time required for the refund to appear in your account may depend on your bank or payment provider.</p><p>Shipping charges may be non-refundable unless the return is due to an error, defect, damage, or another circumstance for which MOKO is responsible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "policy_HULtUm": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Return Shipping",
            "text": "<p>If the return or exchange is due to an incorrect product, manufacturing defect, or damage that occurred before delivery, MOKO may provide an appropriate return solution.</p><p>For other reasons, such as a change of mind or incorrect size selection, the customer may be responsible for applicable return or shipping charges.</p>"
